{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "I had to go undercover when the Keihin Gang put a price on my head.": "",
  "Yeah, I saw that flyer. You're in it deep, huh?": "",
  "I'm trying to crush them by taking out their gun supply. You know anything about it?": "",
  "Sorry, I've not heard a thing.": "",
  "Me neither.": "",
  "Sorry, I'm useless here too.": "",
  "Ah, thanks anyway.": "",
  "Sorry we couldn't be more help, Yagami-san. Maybe this'll help you out, though.": "",
  "Huh? Isn't this one of Iyama-san's extracts? Why do you have this?": "",
  "Heh, I've got connections, man.": "",
  "Those Keihin Gang guys looked pretty serious, Yagami-san. Don't get yourself killed, okay?": "",
  "I'll be fine. Thanks Yosuke-kun.": "",
  "Hey, Seiya. And Deguchi-san.": "",
  "Hm? Wait, what?": "",
  "Is that you, Yagami? Why are you dressed like that?": "",
  "Maybe you've heard about the 10 million yen price on my head?": "",
  "Oh yeah, I did see that! What a bunch of raging assholes!": "",
  "What are you going to do, Yagami-san? You could really end up dead this time...": "",
  "Well, I'm trying to avoid that. My plan right now is to hit them before they hit me.": "",
  "I've got to find their hideout and take it down. That should cut off their funding.": "",
  "W-Wow. You've really given this some thought.": "",
  "I know they're smuggling guns, and that's the key. You haven't heard anything, have you?": "",
  "Sorry, I haven't...": "",
  "Me either. I wish I could help...": "",
  "It's fine. Just don't tell anyone you saw me, and that's plenty.": "",
  "Well, at least take this with you! It'll help keep you on your feet and alert!": "",
  "For you, of course. Stay safe out there!": "",
  "And don't you die.": "",
  "Thanks guys. I plan on staying alive.": "",
  "Sagara-san. Do you have a sec?": "",
  "I know that voice... Is that you, Yagami-san?": "",
  "And what's with the outfit?": "",
  "I see. I wish I knew something that could help...": "",
  "It's totally fine.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I think this is one of those times when you need to steel yourself with a perfect cup of coffee.": "",
  "Here, come inside, please. I won't take much of your time.": "",
  "How was the coffee? That was a certified wild-gathered kopi luwak coffee of the highest grade.": "",
  "Best cup of coffee I've ever had, but if this stuff really costs 10,000 yen a cup, I suppose that's to be expected, right?": "",
  "Well, hard times call for hard coffee!": "",
  "Thank you so much, Sagara-san!": "",
  "I feel better already!": "",
  "Be careful, Yagami-san. You can't enjoy coffee if you're dead.": "",
  "I know. And I plan on enjoying a lot more of it, so don't worry.": "",
  "(It's a long shot... But if I'm gonna get any more info, this is my best chance.)": "",
  "(Apparently their main customers are young guys, so hopefully I'll pick something up if I listen in.)": "",
  "Hahaha... It's pointless, now.": "",
  "Everyone's on the way.": "",
  "Did he say Yagami?": "",
  "Oh, it's really him!": "",
  "Ten milliooooooon!": "",
  "Payday is here!": "",
  "Leave this to us!": "",
  "Anyone who'd harm Yagami-san... is gonna get some extra hot coffee!": "",
  "Yosuke-kun and Deguchi... Even Sagara-san!": "",
  "You Keihin Gang shitheads... You're not getting away with this.": "",
  "Nothing we hand you guys ever comes back... Whether that be money or Yagami-san!": "",
  "Hey, boys! If I showed you some co-ed tits, think you'd forget about that little bounty?": "",
  "Madoka-chan!? What are you doing!?": "",
  "I heard you were in trouble, Yagami-san, but this doesn't look like anything some T&A can't solve! Just this once!": "",
  "Heh, sounds like a lot of people are in debt to you, Yagami-san. Well here's the payback, with interest!": "",
  "Stop messing with my prey, damn it! We'll take you all out!": "",
  "Sorry about this, guys!": "",
  "(For a while there, it felt like the whole city had turned against me...)": "",
  "(But it turns out I had friends in Kamurocho the whole time. I just had to know where to look.)": "",
  "(And I won't let all this effort go to waste!)": "",
  "(I know how to get in touch with the sellers now.)": "",
  "(I have to go to a deserted area and post \"bang bang business\" to Chatter, with my location on.)": "",
  "(And the seller's gonna be a guy in a red scarf.)": "",
  "(All right, let's get this post up.)": "",
  "(Guess I should approach someone...)": "",
  "(But with a ten million yen price on my head... I should probably be cautious about who I talk to.)": "",
  "(Okay... let's be careful about this.)": "",
  "(Is he the seller?)": "",
  "(Nope, that's not him.)": "",
  "(Let's find someone else.)": "",
  "(That guy has a red scarf on his backpack, right?)": "",
  "(I assumed it'd be around his neck, but...)": "",
  "(It's probably this guy. He looks ordinary, but that's gotta be the ruse, right?)": "",
  "What're you looking at?": "",
  "Mind telling me what you're selling?": "",
  "Huh? Selling? Hold on, don't I know you from somewhere?": "",
  "Oh, no, probably not. Sorry.": "",
  "(Whoops. I probably should have waited to find someone who had a red scarf on...)": "",
  "(That's gotta be him. He probably brings his girlfriend to complete the disguise.)": "",
  "You selling anything? I've gotta say, it's a convincing deception.": "",
  "You're disguised as a couple?": "",
  "Uh, maybe not. My bad.": "",
  "(It's probably this guy. He's got the vibe.)": "",
  "You're the gun guy, right?": "",
  "Oh, did I make a mistake?": "",
  "(That was close. Maybe I should try to find a guy with a red scarf.)": "",
  "I-It's none of your business! Are you gonna sell me one or not?": "",
  "Bullets are 10k a pop. You buyin'?": "",
  "I-I'll take a pair of the Chinese made and a single bullet. I'll pay cash.": "",
  "Thanks for your business.": "",
  "Heh heh... I can see the blood draining from their faces already...": "",
  "What about you? You're in the market too, right?": "",
  "Yeah? Suit yourself.": "",
  "(But maybe if I follow this guy, he'll lead me back to his stash.)": "",
  "(I don't see him anywhere...)": "",
  "(Crap! I lost him!)": "",
  "(Is that him?)": "",
  "(Nah, not the guy. Doesn't match the profile.)": "",
  "N-No, I haven't.": "",
  "Hey, now's not a good time, okay? Why don't you clear out? It's for your own good.": "",
  "Eek!": "",
  "Ever heard the one about wielding scissors and fools with extreme caution?": "",
  "You know what, forget it. I don't have time for this level of stupidity. Let's get this over with.": "",
  "Tashiro-kun...": "",
  "Hey, you guys have a sec?": "",
  "Y-Yagami-san. Everything okay?": "",
  "Yeah, I'm fine. But there's a problem. I think the Keihin Gang base might be right below us.": "",
  "You guys use these sewers too, right? Have you seen anything suspicious?": "",
  "I'm sorry... But even if I knew, I couldn't tell you.": "",
  "Wait... You were acting a little off earlier too... Are you being threatened?": "",
  "Yagami-san... I wish I could help, but I can't. I'm sorry.": "",
  "All right. I get it.": "",
  "If it'll help, take this with you.": "",
  "Yeah, it's the least I can do, all things considered.": "",
  "Thanks. Just watch. I'll have them out of here in no time.": "",
  "...Ugh. Thank you, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hm? What do you want?": "",
  "What're you talking about? But I'm getting a weird sensation here...": "",
  "Huh? What do you want?": "",
  "Say what now?": "",
  "You fucking with me, man?": "",
  "So you've got a friend this time, huh?": "",
  "Looks like I'll have to deal with you intruders. That's my job.": "",
  "But if you think this is the end of the Keihin Gang, you're wrong!": "",
  "(A mechanical door, huh...\nMaybe I can short-circuit it if I electrify this puddle.)": "",
  "(It's discharging electricity.\nThat could... really hurt.)": "",
  "(I have to help Sugiura!)": "",
  "(Shono's lab must be somewhere inside\nthis abandoned building. I have to find it.)": "",
  "(I don't have time to turn back.\nGotta push forward.)": "",
  "Man, I got absolutely destroyed last time. As did my liver. So I've been drinking my ass off since... Builds tolerance.": "",
  "Don't think I'll go down easy like last time, all right?": "",
  "You really want your free drinks that bad, huh? Maybe you should trick someone else for a change.": "",
  "Would if I could, but word about me's already spread throughout this entire area.": "",
  "The moment anyone hears about the drinking champ of the Champion District, they freeze up like deer in the headlights!": "",
  "Now let's get down to business! Loser treats the winner, as you may already know.": "",
  "I see. Well, you know where to find me... Come back when you think you can drink!": "",
  "Well, look who it is. You feel like having a drink now? Remember, loser treats the winner. Those're the rules.": "",
  "Now you're talkin'! Then let's get our drink on!": "",
  "More like freeloading champ of the Champion District...": "",
  "This... This is just the tip of the iceberg! It's drink or drown, Yagami! Bottoms up! ": "",
  "Nope. Not feeling it.": "",
  "Still thirsty over here. Feels like I haven't had a drop to drink in weeks, am I right!? Keep 'em comin'!": "",
  "I guess I could drink for a bit.": "",
  "Man, you are handlin' your <font_kind=yakuza_italic>business</font_kind> over there! Me, I'm doin' just fine!": "",
  "Ngh... No siree. I'm done. Throwin' in the towel here.": "",
  "Damn... I can't believe I ended up losin' twice.": "",
  "You know... just seeing that face of yours makes me depressed. Y'oughta buy me a drink regardless of who wins.": "",
  "You can't just decide that on your own...": "",
  "As always, whoever gets too sauced gets slapped with today's bill. Whaddya say?": "",
  "Ah, look who it is. You feel like havin' a drink now? Remember, loser buys for the winner. Those're the rules.": "",
  "Whoo, that's refreshin'! I really needed that. Did you feel anything? Not yet, right? 'Cause we're just gettin' started!": "",
  "You still good? Of course you are! Keep 'em coming, then!": "",
  "That's funny. I actually feel less drunk than when I started. How 'bout you, Yagami? You're lookin' pretty red.": "",
  "Oh... Still goin', huh? Why don't we... order some more...": "",
  "Y-You... can sill... I mean still... keep drinkin'?": "",
  "All right. I guess I have time for a few drinks.": "",
  "Grah! I still can't believe I got outdrinken... outdrank... outdrunk? Whatever! I can't believe I lost to you again!": "",
  "...Yagami, my man, it pains me to admit it, but you're the first person to ever drink me under the table.": "",
  "Good thing the loser doesn't literally get slapped with the bill. You know, 'cause that might hurt.": "",
  "As a testament to your strength... consider me your new ally.": "",
  "Come again?": "",
  "I hear a lot of rumors while I sit here drinkin' my ass off, y'know. Aren't you bein' targeted by the Keihin Gang?": "",
  "Oh... I guess that's cool. Thanks.": "",
  "Well I can't just sit here while a bunch of lowlife punks are messin' with my ally! From now on, I'm gonna step in and help!": "",
  "Then I'll see you on the battlefield!": "",
  "Heh heh heh. Looks like it's your turn to get the drinks!": "",
  "What the...! What are <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> doing here!?": "",
  "What, no cane this time? Well, you're gonna be walking away with <font_kind=yakuza_italic>crutches</font_kind>!": "",
  "Cane? Crutches? The heck...?": "",
  "You must be Yagami! The one my little brother's been harping on about!": "",
  "...Little brother?": "",
  "Yeah! I'm Ryo Suzaki. And the guy you fought at the Soleil Building?": "",
  "He's my twin brother! Though, I'm not a yakuza like him.": "",
  "Ohhh... So that's what's going on. You almost had me for a minute there...": "",
  "So, he even started copying my outfit? Hah... doesn't surprise me.": "",
  "But dang, you guys look so alike. You even wear the same clothes.": "",
  "So he looks up to you, huh? I'll assume you're a respectable citizen then?": "",
  "He's always been trying to one-up me ever since we were kids, the little turd.": "",
  "Yeah right. My idea of a good day is waking up and drinking till I'm sick, then drowning out my thoughts with more alcohol till sundown!": "",
  "So you're saying you're an alcoholic.": "",
  "Aw, \"alcoholic\" is such a harsh term... I'm more what you'd call a free spirit... Someone who consumes spirits freely!": "",
  "Wow. Guess you both have changed a lot since you were kids.": "",
  "Sure 'nuff. Now I tell you what, Yagami-san, drinks are on me today. To make up for all the trouble my little brother caused you.": "",
  "Oh yeah. But on only one condition: you gotta outdrink me to earn it! Loser treats the winner. Those're the rules.": "",
  "Heh. Did I scare you away? You're free to run along if you can't take the pressure.": "",
  "Well, look who it is. You feel like having a drink now? Remember, loser buys for the winner. Those're the rules.": "",
  "...So that's how you've been weaseling free drinks out of people? Nice try, but I'm not falling for it.": "",
  "Nope. Not even feeling it.": "",
  "Well, well. Looks like you can hang after all. Good, 'cause I'm just getting warmed up!": "",
  "You talk like you're a pretty heavy drinker... but then again, so am I. Ready to start when you are.": "",
  "Huh... You sure can handle your liquor. But can you handle another round?": "",
  "Hah! I guess you really weren't all talk! Why don't we call it a day?": "",
  "Damn. Never thought I'd lose when it comes to drinkin' booze... I gotta rebuild myself from scotch... er, scratch.": "",
  "Hehe. Cheers to you, then.": "",
  "Guess today's drinks are on my dime, eh? Those're the rules.": "",
  "Agh... That's it. I'm wasted right now.": "",
  "What the hell was that? You were babysitting your drink the whole time!": "",
  "...Bleahh.": "",
  "I guess the bill's on you today. Don't worry, you can leave the cash with me.": "",
  "Yo. Yagami. You better stick around till the end today.": "",
  "...Now let's get to drinkin'!": "",
  "Guess drinks are on your dime today. \"Those're the rules,\" right?": "",
  "Yeah, I suppose. After all, a man's word is his bond. But let it be known I'll get that free drink outta you someday!": "",
  "Shoot... That's it for me.": "",
  "Heh heh heh. Looks like the tab's on you, buddy!": "",
  "You know I'm always here drinkin' the day away, so come back and challenge me again sometime.": "",
  "Yo, Yagami. You better be able to hang this time around.": "",
  "(Huh. From the bar to the battlefield, this guy just keeps on boozing. What a strange ally I've gained.)": "",
  "I got myself another free drink today, thanks to you. Let's do this again, Yagami.": "",
  "Sorry, I'm a little strapped for cash right now.": "",
  "What gives? I thought you were supposed to be a working member of society.": "",
  "I don't want to hear that from someone who doesn't even have a job. I'll be back.": "",
  "You'd better buy me a drink next time, then. Later!": "",
  "(Darts is 200 yen per play... Should I play?)": "",
  "(Nah, maybe not.)": "",
  "(I'm too poor for even one go... This is rough.)": "",
  "Oh god. What do I do, what do I do... WHAT DO I DO!? Perhaps I should just leave this mortal shell behind!": "",
  "(Whoa... What's he trying to pull here?)": "",
  "This is the only solution I have left! Getting hit by a car isn't the cleanest way out, but it's all I can think of at this point!": "",
  "Hey! Stop! What do you think you're doing!?": "",
  "Just let me eat pavement, okay!? I've already accepted becoming one with the universe, so bug off!": "",
  "Get a hold of yourself, man!": "",
  "...Well? Now that you've calmed down a bit, mind telling me why you were so eager to turn yourself into roadkill?": "",
  "*sigh* It... It all started with the company I work at.\nG.A. Labs.": "",
  "G.A. Labs?": "",
  "It's an IT company. We released a really popular app two years ago that's been blowing up ever since.": "",
  "Since we rose to the top of the market, we've decided to build our own corporate office. And they put me in charge.": "",
  "That's something to be proud of.": "",
  "It would be, if I hadn't miscalculated the budget. Because of my incompetence, we ended up short on construction funds.": "",
  "Ouch.": "",
  "I'm pretty sure I'll be fired once the president finds out. Before that happens... I'll be resting in the afterlife!": "",
  "Can you not think like that? I mean, it all just comes down to money, right?": "",
  "...Yes. But how am I supposed to gather that money!?": "",
  "Ever heard of an app called Quickstarter? Why don't you start a fundraiser on there?": "",
  "Wait, what is that?": "",
  "It's a crowdfunding platform. One of the latest trends.": "",
  "You mean like... a public donation project? That... may just work!": "",
  "Good. Now don't go doing anything reckless again, okay?": "",
  "Okay! I definitely won't... Er, what's your name?": "",
  "I'm Takayuki Yagami.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I am forever in your debt! You're a miracle worker!": "",
  "(...Sheesh. What a melodramatic guy.)": "",
  "(Maybe I'll donate every now and then to help his project along.)": "",
  "Oh! Yagami-san! Thank you for helping me out that one time.": "",
  "Oh yeah. How's that going, anyway?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Me neither.": "ฉันก็เหมือนกันนะ",
  "Eek!": "กรี๊ด!",
  "Hm? What do you want?": "หืม? อยากได้อะไร?",
  "Huh? What do you want?": "หา? มีอะไรเหรอ?",
  "Say what now?": "ว่าไงนะ?",
  "Come again?": "ว่าไงนะ?",
  "(Nah, maybe not.)": "(ไม่เอาดีกว่า)",
  "Ouch.": "โอ๊ย"
 }
}
